%[text] %[text:anchor:H_981f] ## Further Explorations
%[text] You can take advantage of overloading functions by defining different versions of a function that accept different sets of arguments using [`varargin`](https://www.mathworks.com/help/matlab/ref/varargin.html) or different sets of output using [`varargout`](https://www.mathworks.com/help/matlab/ref/varargout.html).
